<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About - Ink & Anchor</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
    <link href="https://googleapis.com" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
        .display { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; }
        .paper-texture { background-image: radial-gradient(#8c60460d 0.8px, transparent 0.8px); background-size: 12px 12px; }
        @keyframes story-rise {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        .story-step { animation: story-rise .7s ease-out both; }
        .story-step:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .15s; }
        .story-step:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .3s; }
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            .story-step { animation: none; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#F3EBDD] text-[#2C2725]">
    <%- include('includes/nav.ejs') %>

    <main class="paper-texture">
        <section class="relative overflow-hidden px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
            <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-20 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-[#789165]/15 blur-3xl"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 -left-20 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-[#6B2737]/10 blur-3xl"></div>
            <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl">
                <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-[#B08D57]/50 bg-white/40 px-5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[#6B2737]">
                        <span>✦</span> Our Story <span>✦</span>
                    </span>
                    <h1 class="display mt-7 text-6xl font-medium leading-none text-[#3A2922] md:text-8xl">A world between<br><span class="italic text-[#6B2737]">every cover.</span></h1>
                    <p class="mx-auto mt-7 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-[#3A2922]/75 md:text-lg">Welcome to Ink & Anchor — a little sanctuary for curious minds, quiet moments, and stories that stay with you long after the final page.</p>
                    <a href="/books" class="mt-9 inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#6B2737] px-7 py-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#F3EBDD] shadow-lg shadow-[#6B2737]/15 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-[#3A2922]">Explore the collection <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-20 md:pb-28" aria-labelledby="journey-title">
            <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[#B08D57]/35 bg-[#FFFCF5]/75 shadow-xl">
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[.85fr_1.15fr]">
                    <div class="relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden bg-[#294536] p-8 text-[#F3EBDD] md:p-12">
                        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-20 -right-16 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-[#D4B77A]/15 blur-3xl"></div>
                        <div class="relative">
                            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[#D4B77A]">The Ink &amp; Anchor way</p>
                            <h2 id="journey-title" class="display mt-5 text-4xl leading-tight md:text-5xl">Every great read<br>starts with a <span class="italic text-[#E7C98A]">little curiosity.</span></h2>
                            <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-[#F3EBDD]/75">We make it easy to move from “I wonder…” to the first page of something wonderful.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="relative mt-10 border-l border-[#D4B77A]/50 pl-5">
                            <p class="display text-2xl italic text-[#E7C98A]">“A book is a harbor for the imagination.”</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-2 p-6 md:p-10">
                        <article class="story-step group flex gap-5 rounded-2xl p-5 transition duration-300 hover:bg-[#E8DDC8]/50">
                            <span class="display flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#B08D57]/50 text-xl text-[#6B2737] transition group-hover:bg-[#6B2737] group-hover:text-[#F3EBDD]">01</span>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="display text-2xl font-semibold text-[#3A2922]">Wander the shelves</h3>
                                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#3A2922]/65">Browse the collection or explore by category until a title catches your eye.</p>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                        <article class="story-step group flex gap-5 rounded-2xl p-5 transition duration-300 hover:bg-[#E8DDC8]/50">
                            <span class="display flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#B08D57]/50 text-xl text-[#6B2737] transition group-hover:bg-[#6B2737] group-hover:text-[#F3EBDD]">02</span>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="display text-2xl font-semibold text-[#3A2922]">Find your next chapter</h3>
                                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#3A2922]/65">Take your time discovering stories, subjects, and new perspectives.</p>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                        <article class="story-step group flex gap-5 rounded-2xl p-5 transition duration-300 hover:bg-[#E8DDC8]/50">
                            <span class="display flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#B08D57]/50 text-xl text-[#6B2737] transition group-hover:bg-[#6B2737] group-hover:text-[#F3EBDD]">03</span>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="display text-2xl font-semibold text-[#3A2922]">Settle in and enjoy</h3>
                                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-[#3A2922]/65">Choose a book, get comfortable, and let the outside world grow quiet for a while.</p>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                        <div class="px-5 pt-3">
                            <a href="/categories" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-[#6B2737] px-6 py-3.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#F3EBDD] transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-[#3A2922]">Start exploring <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('includes/footer.ejs') %>
</body>
</html>
